  "_sources": "Identification (modelId 'GL-C-008', manufacturerName 'GLEDOPTO') from the wishlist export and the zigbee-herdsman-converters 26.128.0 definition; color temperature range 153-500 mired from that definition. Gledopto ZLL controller layout from the GL-C-008 family fingerprint in zigbee-herdsman-converters gledopto.js: ep 11 ZLL (device 0x0210) with Basic/Identify/Groups/Scenes/OnOff/Level/Color, ep 13 ZLL commissioning. Basic version/date attributes are representative, not captured.",
